  "text": "AUSTRALIAN STEVEDORING INDUSTRY BOARD\nG.P.O. Box 556,\nSydney.\n9th June, 1955.\nDear Charles,\nI was delighted to read in\nthis morning's paper of the decoration\nwhich had been conferred upon you in\nthe Birthday Honours list.\nI join with all the friends\nho will be congratulating you on this\nvery well merited honour.\nI hope that\nwhen next you are over I\nshall have the\npleasure of celebrating it with you.\nWith best wishes,\nYours sincerely,\ngrubbertt\nc. H. McFadyen, Esq., C.B.E.,\nsecretary.\nDepartment of Shipping and Transport.\n497 Collins Street,\nMelbourne.\nKEITH, BİLL SUNR. ANA MARiE",
